      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE VICARS GIRL (6) settled close to the pace before taking the lead and going on with the job to take out a 2230m race at this track last start, adding to her fine victory the run prior at Port Pirie. Has the class to win again. MAESTRO (5) settled in the leading division then pressed on to find the lead and maintained the momentum to take out a 2190m race at Maryborough last start, a pleasing improvement on his sixth the run prior at Warragul. Finds a suitable assignment and will take plenty of beating once more. SAMMY BARBARO (1) must be considered after he finished third over 1800m at this track a week ago. SETTLE THE BILL (4) could only finish sixth over 2230m at this track most recently. Open to improvement and is in the mix.",
